{
    "_about": [
        "The payloads the preview streams, in the shapes py-backend sends them.",
        "py-backend/tests/test_widget_preview_samples.py rebuilds each one through the backend's own code",
        "(visual_payload, AskUserPayload, SseProjector, ChatTurnStream, flatten_history_for_ui, the chat routes...),",
        "so a backend change to one of these shapes fails there, naming the sample to update.",
        "{placeholders} are filled in per session by preview/replies.mjs and fake-wap.mjs.",
        "A null is a value the fake sets itself (a visual, a document, media); the test checks the key is there."
